            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This dataset contains data, per EU-27 country and 153 additional countries and territories (the World). The data displays the total number of publications per country, per topic, as well as the number of EC sponsored publications. Aggregates for EU-27, EU-28 and the World are also provided. The dataset also contains data and metrics specifying the prominence (momentum) of the topics on which the sponsored outputs where published.\nNext to the above data, additional data also contained in https://doi.org/10.34894/DNWIXV and used in the 2nd Interim Report is added as a comparison, showing the difference in topical outputs for the main knowledge economies and the world. \nNote: the World is defined by 180 countries and territories that have produced output in the 23755 topics."
                },
